---
import SectionHeader from "./SectionHeader.astro";
---

<section class="w-full bg-[#f6f6f9] border-t border-b border-black/[0.06] text-left relative z-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 py-28 sm:py-36">
    
    <!-- Narrative Chapter Header: Clearly Signals a Shift to Studio Philosophy -->
    <SectionHeader
      number="02"
      title="The Philosophy"
      subtitle="Studio DNA"
      rightLabel="Values & Methodology"
      className="mb-20 sm:mb-24"
    />

    <!-- Chapter Statement -->
    <div class="mb-20 sm:mb-28 max-w-4xl">
      <h2 class="font-hero-minimal text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-neutral-950 font-normal tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.15] mb-4">
        Engineering with conviction. Driven by autonomous systems.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-hero-minimal text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700 font-light leading-relaxed">
        How KerrShift approaches product craft, engineering velocity, and building enduring software for clients and partners.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Principles: Generous Whitespace Layout with Clear Hierarchy -->
    <div class="space-y-16 sm:space-y-24 border-t border-black/[0.08] pt-16">
      
      <!-- Principle 01: Production Primitives -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-16 items-baseline pb-16 border-b border-black/[0.06]">
        <div class="md:col-span-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">Tenet 01</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9">
          <h3 class="font-hero-minimal text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-neutral-950 font-normal tracking-tight mb-4">
            Production-Grade Primitives
          </h3>
          <p class="font-hero-minimal text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            We don't ship brittle prototypes or throwaway code. Everything we architect is engineered to endure—resilient, clean, fully typed, and ready to support actual business scale from day one.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Principle 02: AI-First Velocity -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-16 items-baseline pb-16 border-b border-black/[0.06]">
        <div class="md:col-span-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">Tenet 02</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9">
          <h3 class="font-hero-minimal text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-neutral-950 font-normal tracking-tight mb-4">
            AI-Augmented Velocity
          </h3>
          <p class="font-hero-minimal text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            We leverage autonomous workflows, deep verification loops, and agentic pipelines to compress development cycles from quarters into weeks—delivering high-craft products with unprecedented speed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Principle 03: Zero Bloat -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-16 items-baseline">
        <div class="md:col-span-3 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">Tenet 03</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-9">
          <h3 class="font-hero-minimal text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-neutral-950 font-normal tracking-tight mb-4">
            Zero Bloat Architecture
          </h3>
          <p class="font-hero-minimal text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-700 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            Clean code, minimal dependencies, and rapid response times. We build software that feels instantaneous to users and remains lightweight and maintainable for your internal team.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
